          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda ne bakola ebibi mu maaso ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.14.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", okusinga ne bajjajjaabwe bye baakola era ebibi byabwe ne bikwasa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.14.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obuggya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beezimbira ebifo ebigulumivu n'empagi za Baaseri ku buli lusozi oluwanvu ne wansi wa buli muti omugazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era waaliwo n'abaalyanga ebisiyaga mu nsi, ne bakolanga eby'emizizo byonna abamawanga Katonda be yagoba mu maaso g'Abayisirayiri bye baakolanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ogwokutaano ogw'obufuzi bwa kabaka Lekobowaamu, Sisaki kabaka w'e Misiri n'alumba Yerusaalemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'atwala eby'obugagga eby'omu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.14.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", n'ebyobugagga eby'omu lubiri lwa kabaka byonna, ng'okwo kw'otadde engabo eza zaabu Sulemaani ze yali akoze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo kabaka Lekobowaamu n'akola engabo ez'ebikomo okuzzaawo ziri, era n'azikwasa abaduumizi b'abambowa abaakuumanga wankaaki w'olubiri lwa kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli Kabaka lwe yalaganga mu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.14.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", abambowa ne bambalira engabo ezo, era Oluvannyuma ne bazizaayo mu kisenge ky'abambowa we zaaterekebwanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyafaayo ebirala byonna eby'omulembe gwa Lekobowaamu, ne bye yakola byonna, tebyawandiikibwa mu kitabo eky'ebyomumirembe gya bassekabaka ba Yuda?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waabangawo entalo ez'olubeerera wakati wa Lekobowaamu ne Yerobowaamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lekobowaamu ne yeebakira wamu ne bajjajjaabe, era n'aziikibwa mu kibuga kya Dawudi. Nnyina yayitibwanga Naama Omwamoni. Abiyaamu mutabani we n'amusikira, n'alya obwakabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
